  "description": "REVWAQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C77 H80 N8 Na2 Nd4 O19,1.5(C4 H10 O2). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.803-4.024 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.13-115.36°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C77H80N8Na2Nd4O19·1.5(C4H10O2).",
